    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why im typing this lol. just feels like im running on a treadmill that wont stop and i'm just getting more and more tired. every single thing i try to do to fix my life just makes it worse. the debt, the job, the expectations... it's just constant. i feel like i'm just failing everyone around me by even being here. like im just a weight they all have to carry.",
